      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "Lost and in need of guidance (the navigational kind, not the spiritual kind), I made my way into an impressive Avian temple. Immediately I felt at peace, like a calm had descended over me. I walked the stone hallways, gazing up at the statues of that giant bird, occasionally greeting priests and worshippers alike. They seemed pleased to see me."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "迷子になって、ガイダンス(精神的な種類ではなく、航海的な種類)を必要としている、私は印象的なアビアン寺院に道を歩んだ。 すぐに私は平和な気分になりました静けさが身をかがめたように石の廊下を歩き巨大な鳥の像を眺めながら時折神官や崇拝者にも挨拶をしました 彼らは私を見て喜んだようだった。"
    }
  ],
